[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "What does 'a cold welcome' refer to?",
    "start": 9.411,
    "end": 13.173,
    "zh": "“冷遇”指的是什么？",
    "zh_hant": "“冷遇”指的是什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "On Wednesday evening, we went to the Town Hall.",
    "start": 15.234,
    "end": 19.036,
    "zh": "星期三晚上，我们去了市政厅。",
    "zh_hant": "星期三晚上，我們去了市政廳。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "It was the last day of the year and a large crowd of people had gathered",
    "start": 19.276,
    "end": 24.878,
    "zh": "那是一年的最后一天，一大群人聚集",
    "zh_hant": "那是一年的最後一天，一大群人聚集"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "under the Town Hall clock.",
    "start": 24.538,
    "end": 26.679,
    "zh": "在市政厅大钟下面。",
    "zh_hant": "在市政廳大鐘下面。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "It would strike twelve in twenty minutes' time.",
    "start": 27.3,
    "end": 30.661,
    "zh": "二十分钟后，它就要敲响十二点了。",
    "zh_hant": "二十分鐘後，它就要敲響十二點了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Fifteen minutes passed and then, at five to twelve, the clock stopped.",
    "start": 31.482,
    "end": 37.445,
    "zh": "十五分钟过去了，然后在十二点差五分时，钟停了。",
    "zh_hant": "十五分鐘過去了，然後在十二點差五分時，鐘停了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "The big minute hand did not move.",
    "start": 37.865,
    "end": 40.586,
    "zh": "巨大的分针没有移动。",
    "zh_hant": "巨大的分針沒有移動。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "We waited and waited, but nothing happened.",
    "start": 40.726,
    "end": 44.608,
    "zh": "我们等了又等，但什么也没发生。",
    "zh_hant": "我們等了又等，但什麼也沒發生。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "Suddenly someone shouted.",
    "start": 45.209,
    "end": 47.269,
    "zh": "突然有人喊了起来。",
    "zh_hant": "突然有人喊了起來。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "'It's two minutes past twelve!",
    "start": 46.919,
    "end": 50.453,
    "zh": "“已经十二点过两分了！",
    "zh_hant": "“已經十二點過兩分了！"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "The clock has stopped!'",
    "start": 50.434,
    "end": 52.615,
    "zh": "钟停了！”",
    "zh_hant": "鐘停了！”"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "I looked at my watch.",
    "start": 53.097,
    "end": 54.678,
    "zh": "我看了看自己的手表。",
    "zh_hant": "我看了看自己的手錶。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "It was true.",
    "start": 54.698,
    "end": 55.959,
    "zh": "确实如此。",
    "zh_hant": "確實如此。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "The big clock refused to welcome the New Year.",
    "start": 56.32,
    "end": 60.244,
    "zh": "大钟拒绝迎接新年。",
    "zh_hant": "大鐘拒絕迎接新年。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "At that moment, everybody began to laugh and sing.",
    "start": 60.625,
    "end": 65.35,
    "zh": "那一刻，大家开始又笑又唱。",
    "zh_hant": "那一刻，大家開始又笑又唱。"
  }
]
